  "worked_solution": "Let's plot the graph of $y=cot\u2061x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13934292/assets/22674bef9e806fca07026b8d441877c251761de4c64cc005eed912e62a34ce67.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is true. The period of $y=cot\u2061x$ is $\\pi .$\n\n- Statement II is false. The function is decreasing over $(0,\\pi ).$\n\n- Statement III is false. The function is not defined at $x=\\pi .$",
